==============================================

This file states the licensing obligations that apply to the **binaries** this
project publishes, and how they are met. It is written to be read alongside two
other artifacts that ship with every release:

  * `LICENSE`          — the MIT License (option 1 of 2, below).
  * `LICENSE-APACHE`   — the Apache License, Version 2.0, complete and verbatim
                         (option 2 of 2, below).
  * `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt` — generated per release by
                         `scripts/generate-third-party-notices.sh`: crate,
